            "review_title": "Review at Hang Duong Quan Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Sarah Nguyen\nHanoi, Vietnam100 contributions\n1\nGood for receiving customers\nMar 2019 • Business\nBecause of receiving customers, we needed a polite restaurant, so with returning to Saigon too late, it was hard to find\nArriving in Saigon, it was nearly 10pm, I tried to contact a lot of restaurants, but they all announced that they did not accept guests after 9:30 - 10pm, thankfully my friend introduced us This restaurant, They can receive oder until 10:30\nGreat , at least this restaurant is quite good, clean and luxurious,\nWe choose the top floor of the restaurant, can see the city from above.\nI like big crabs ( form Canada and USA ), but because there are only 4 people, I hope can try it on next time…\nThe food brought up quickly, it is also quite good,\nIn particular, they have giant Mekong fish species\nEnthusiastic staff, serving us near 12pm.\nWine is not much, but it is also acceptable.\nBecause of receiving guests, I couldn't take photos of the dishes.\nBut it is a good choice if you have a business trip and must return to the city later.\nPrice is quite high...\nRead more\nWritten April 22, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
