            "review_text": "desiremmwekb10\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2964 contributions\n0\nAmazing restaurant\nOct 2016 • Friends\nWell decorated restaurants offers high quality food. Normally I do not like restaurants that serve such a wide range of variety because they tend to showcase mediocre food; however this restaurant is different. The variety does not affect the quality and taste. They always have some huge fish (fish that weight over 100kg). These fish taste like steak, absolutely muat try. Love the location, the food, the service, the restaurant itself.\nRead more\nWritten October 30, 2016",
