            "review_text": "Katherine Pham\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nAmazing restaurant that must be shared!\nMay 2016 • Business\nGood seafood restaurant that offers some huge seafood products. You could find giant clam, giant shell, huge fishes here.They have 3 branches at District 1, 4 and 7. I went to the branch in 32 34 Ngo Duc Ke street, Ben Nghe Ward, district 1. The restaurant has very nice indoor seats. Service was good and fast! Overall experience is satisfied. Seafood lovers should definitely try out this place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 25, 2016",
